       reports to the Pi) until the user allows it; these keys make macOS
       ask instead of silently dropping it. -->
  <key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key><string>Pixregie envoie l'état de tes sessions Claude Code à l'écran Pixregie de ton réseau local.</string>
  <key>NSBonjourServices</key><array><string>_pixregie._tcp</string></array>
  <key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key><string>MIT · not affiliated with Anthropic</string>
</dict>
</plist>
